  "description": "<p>This area rug offers both comfort and inspiration, featuring a traditional style with a faith floral design. Crafted for durability and ease of care, it enhances various indoor spaces. The rug can be personalized, making it a unique addition to any home or church setting.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational faith floral design.</li>\n<li>Can be personalized with a name, family name, or special message.</li>\n<li>Made with soft polyester fabric and an anti-slip backing for safety.</li>\n<li>Wrinkle-resistant, fade-resistant, and long-lasting.</li>\n<li>Suitable for various home and church uses, including prayer, meditation, and general decor.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Gamer Room, Reading Nook, Entryway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith, Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning or machine wash for deeper care.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for enhancing the atmosphere in various indoor settings. It is well-suited for bedrooms, living rooms, offices, gamer rooms, cozy reading nooks, and entryways. Its design also makes it appropriate for use in church spaces or meditation corners.</p>",
